From e8c2d3138b05967697781920e96aa481317e493a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:02:17 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: the file list shows the cups cleared instead of the
 Djinn

SaveFileSummary.djinn[4] becomes cups[4]: the cups cleared in each tier of trophies (bronze
= cups 0 and 1, silver = 2 and 3, gold = 4 to 6, blue = the side cups), counted by
Save_BuildFileSummary from the trophy flags (FLAG_ARENA_TROPHY_FIRST + cup). The file list
draws the lobby's four trophy sprites (309, 310, 311, 313) over the two-digit counts, in the
place of the Djinn; a tier with no cup gets no sprite, and a file with none shows no
window. FileList_{Show,Hide,Place}DjinnSprites and FileList_DrawDjinnCounts become
...TrophySprites and ...TrophyCounts. The same code serves the title screen's Continue and
the Pause menu's Save. New saves only (an old save's Djinn counts would read as cups).

No paging: the tiers keep it at four sprites however many cups there are. (L and R are free
in the file list, which only uses Up, Down, A and B, if it is wanted later.)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
